        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="example-115" value="Worked example: PR #115&#10;Implementing agent discovered mid-flight&#10;that GitHub Environment binding mutates&#10;OIDC JWT sub, breaking bootstrap trust.&#10;Stopped. Posted decision log. Waited for&#10;operator approval before re-scoping.&#10;Designed stop-and-surface, not failure." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fillColor=#F0F4FA;strokeColor=#232F3E;rounded=1;spacing=8;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="1020" width="340" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="example-150" value="Worked example: PR #151 / Issue #150&#10;Phase A operator-execution. Bootstrap&#10;MSYS fix, orphan VPC cleanup ($100/mo&#10;saved), legacy IAM role deletion (gha-apply&#10;had IAMFullAccess). Three surprises,&#10;each surfaced and authorized. Day-1&#10;sequence executed cleanly post-fix." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fillColor=#F0FCE6;strokeColor=#34A853;rounded=1;spacing=8;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
